apns.h1_f:
POST https://api.push.apple.com/3/device/<device_token>
Päised: apns-topic: <bundle_id>, apns-push-type: alert, apns-collapse-id: room:42
Keha: {aps: {alert: {title, body}}, andmed: <suled>}

bmp.h1_f:
mailbox_id = HKDF(saaja_pubkey, info="bmp-v1", len=32)
Sissemakse: POST /bmp/deposit {mailbox_id, blob ≤1MB}
Vastuvõtmine: GET /bmp/messages (auth'd)

