GET /v1/health → {olek, versioon, pubkey, statistika}
GET /v1/entries → [{protocol, url}, …]
GET /v1/peeglid → [kontrolleri_url, …]

fcm.h1_f:
POST https://fcm.googleapis.com/v1/projects/<project>/messages:send
Volitus: kandja <oauth2_token>
Keha: {sõnum: {märk: <seade>, andmed: {...suletud...}, android: {collapse_key}}}

